  "instructions": [
    "Preheat the oven to 400 degrees Fahrenheit",
    "Season the cod fish with tandoor spice mix, salt, and black pepper",
    "Heat the olive oil in a skillet and sear the cod fish until browned",
    "Add the bruised lemongrass to the skillet and cook for 1 minute",
    "Wrap each cod fish piece in a lotus leaf and place on a baking sheet",
    "Sprinkle the shredded mozzarella cheese over the fish",
    "Bake in the preheated oven for 12 minutes or until the cheese is melted and bubbly",
    "Serve immediately and enjoy"
